":49,"source":50,"firmware_min":23,"verified_on":25,"confidence":31},"base-note","The unit writes the root note into the metadata of the WAVs it records.","https://teenage.engineering/downloads/op-xy#1.0.45",{"id":52,"text":53,"source":54,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":55},"octave","Current factory and device files name notes with C4 = 60, older device files with C3 = 60; metadata avoids the mix-up.","docs/research/30-presets-samples.md#34-note-names-in-file-names-the-octave-question","community-verified",{"id":57,"text":58,"source":59,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":55},"device-format","Recordings examined so far are 16-bit, 44.1 kHz mono WAV files.","docs/research/30-presets-samples.md#31-formats",{"id":61,"text":62,"source":63,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":31},"names","File names should use only letters, digits, spaces, - and #.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/how-to#how-to-load-samples",{"id":65,"text":66,"source":67,"firmware_min":24,"verified_on":25,"confidence":31},"nesting","Folders can nest more than one level deep.","https://teenage.engineering/downloads/op-xy#1.1.15",{"id":69,"text":70,"source":71,"firmware_min":22,"verified_on":25,"confidence":31},"memory","A project can have up to 64 MB of samples loaded at once.","https://teenage.engineering/downloads/op-xy#1.0.25",[],[],[75,76,77],"sampler.sample-library","com.mtp","project.system-usage-indicators","Anything copied into the samples folder shows up in the library, sorted by folder. Give files a root\nnote in their metadata, or a note name in the file name, so the samplers play them in tune.",[80,82,84,86,87,88,89,90],{"url":30,"kind":81},"guide",{"url":38,"kind":83},"research",{"url":50,"kind":85},"changelog",{"url":54,"kind":83},{"url":59,"kind":83},{"url":63,"kind":81},{"url":67,"kind":85},{"url":71,"kind":85},[],{"id":11,"title":93},"Sampler",{"id":75,"title":95},"Sample library",{"basics.key-notation":97,"basics.main-modes":98,"basics.mo